-------------------------------- upgrade-v1.1 ------------------------------------

        Upgrades to MODTRAN 3.5 will be put on the anonymous ftp site in directory
mod3.5-changes. Check the anonymous ftp site at the beginning of the month for
upgrades. Users will receive notice of major upgrades. The anonymous ftp site will
have the latest Readme file and a complete Documentation.dir, Changes.dir, and
Case.dir. Only the modified source files will be in Source.dir/SOURCE, as opposed
to the full source code which is only available on the password ftp site. The 
bandmodel in DATA will not be on the anonymous ftp site.


	Version 1.1 has one correction fixing an error if a ground altitude of < 6 km 
is used with a model atmosphere.

